WEBVTT

00:16:57.927 --> 00:17:02.724
the Chinese education system
now incorporates

00:17:02.748 --> 00:17:05.795
automatic homework grading,

00:17:05.819 --> 00:17:09.239
automatic test and exam grading,

00:17:09.263 --> 00:17:14.121
so the teacher hardly
has to grade anything anymore.

00:17:14.145 --> 00:17:16.044
Not only for multiple choice,

00:17:16.068 --> 00:17:19.195
but also fill in the blank,
make a sentence,

00:17:19.219 --> 00:17:23.926
mathematical proof or a chemical equation.

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:28.069
All of those are still
written on a paper exam,

00:17:28.093 --> 00:17:29.982
but graded automatically.